        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Okay, I tried to figure out how to achieve this via builtin methods like `events` you mentioned.\r\nLet's assume I want to set the min width for the info window to 6 for example. \r\nCan you please provide some hint to me how this can be done. I couldn't figured it out how to do this without changing the the underling core lua code.\r\n\r\nThanks in advance @echasnovski  :-)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"961\" height=\"471\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260306_123951-1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96e089ca-5eb3-4245-8fb7-93056df5b237\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
            "created_at": "2026-03-06T11:49:35Z",
